    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970409.0126\n\nMOSCOW, April 9 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENTYeltsin to take two weeks' holiday in April\n\n\n\n\nRussian President Boris Yeltsin will take two weeks' holiday after his visit to Germany in mid-April, the Kremlin told AFP.\n\nThe holiday will be spent in Sochi, on the Black Sea. Yeltsin is expected to be in Germany on April 17-18.",
